      "disposition": "exact_action_ineligible",
      "rationale": "Clyde amendment1 inserts an exclusion into proposed NEPA judicial-review direct-harm standing condition: aesthetic, recreational or emotional interests unaccompanied by material physical or property harm. Complete RH page26 line8 target and Report/floor wording match. Does not abolish all standing or categorically exclude such interests when accompanied by the specified harm; not a personal admission/status/removal rule. Initial voice ayes, Huffman recorded-demand, actual postponement, resumed recorded-demand/order and own rejection remain distinct. Exact Foushee/Massie labels retained; no component-preference, motive, ideology, character, corruption, endorsement or voting recommendation inferred. Established member-neutral functional Immigration-domain exclusion candidate only, noncounting/unapproved; no new meaning, question, package, ontology or methodology.",
