      "disposition": "exact_action_ineligible",
      "rationale": "Full passed H.R.3898 PERMIT Act sections1-26 read, not only Clerk title or a parent water caption. Qualified water-quality standards/criteria cost-technology transparency, direct-discharge State certification/writing/90-day conditions, energy review economic-harm/each-organization-member standing and30/120+60 clocks; general ten-year permits/pollutant-specific shields, firefighting/pesticide/stormwater conditions, dredge-fill veto timing/acreage/linear-project scope, general-permit reissuance and ESA/EA conditions, State programmes/withdrawal Congress/Florida transition, compensatory mitigation qualifiers, backlog/1985 conversions/10-year wetland exclusion, spill capacity thresholds, FAST encouragement, Chesapeake expressive provision and voluntary recharge/hydropower/pilot/no-expanded-jurisdiction/report conditions are separate. Section26 US Section of United States-Mexico IBWC accepts qualified Federal/nonFederal funds for wastewater/water-conservation/flood-control works consistent with Commission functions, Treasury account subject to appropriations/untilspent and nonFederal credits/reimbursements capped5million per fiscalyear, annual reporting. Foreign-country-of-concern funding exclusion concerns nonFederal entity domicile/headquarters/organization/principal-business/agreement, not individual nationality/status/admission or migration enforcement. Incorporated19237(2) defines PRC/DPRK/Russia/Iran or other Secretary-of-State designated country only; neighboring entity/terrorism/recruitment/individual definitions not incorporated. Crossborder water infrastructure is not automatically immigration-domain eligibility. No actual wastewater harm, security finding, permit application, treaty consequence, causality, cost/benefit or enactment claim. Own direct passage voice ayes, recorded yeas/nays demand/order and passage retained; no postponed question invented. Exact Foushee/Massie labels retained; no component-preference, motive, ideology, character, corruption, endorsement or voting recommendation inferred. Established member-neutral functional Immigration-domain exclusion candidate only, noncounting/unapproved; no new meaning, question, package, ontology or methodology.",
